{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Large mixed breed","breed_primary":"Large Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"Since I'm a long stay pup, my adoption fee has been reduced! Visit me today to find out my favorite treats and how you can take me home!\n\nMy Boroughbreaker writes: We walked to 2 parks, Melo was \"mellow\" on the leash, no hard pulling and no negative reactivity to dogs or strangers. Melo did want to play with the dogs we passed but he was easy enough to redirect. Melo loved watching the world go by, he sat calmly at my feet on the park benches, watching the kids run, looking at the passer-by's, the falling leaves, taking in his surroundings. He would be perfect for someone who has time to visit the sites of the city and look around. Melo was tolerant of the Ninja costume I put on him but was happy to get rid of that within 1 block of donning (he's a lover not a fighter)! Melo is a good, good boy and I wish him the well in his journey to find a home. I would gladly take him on another Break and could even host a Staycation.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=2&searchType=4&animalid=184661","id":"ac079080601e4e9ea62ebe78751330b7","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/662744b7ce7b41df955c9b6190dcc264-1793310696-1793310699-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/7a0bb7a0eac84381a027e583432ed279-1778112474-1782251625-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/37d6d1638c7847b2b8de1d832ecc678e-1778112475-1778112475-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/098c1231540a4b9db407b6fc65c73a4a-1778112475-1778112475-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/1c8f99f2ae8847749ec7e14d137044b6-1778112474-1778112474-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shel